#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use IBM Cloud to manage users with IBM Cloud accounts"
msgstr ""

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage IBM Cloud users"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Manage IBM Cloud users {#manage-ibm-cloud-users}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates how to use IBM Cloud&reg; to enable users who have "
"IBM Cloud accounts and gives instructions for users to access the "
"environment.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To manage ID provider users instead, follow the instructions in the [Manage "
"ID providers](/guides/manage-appid) topic.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Steps {#steps}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these high-level steps to manage IBM Cloud users:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure that the users that you want to invite have IBM Cloud accounts.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to IAM and [invite users](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users/invite_users)\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Users cannot be managed until they accept the invitation and log in at least once.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Optional: Modify users' project assignments and access groups from "
"[IAM](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"user-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "User flow {#user-flow}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The user accepts an invitation, then logs on through the [IBM Cloud "
"portal](https://cloud.ibm.com/).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The user creates an API key by going to ([Manage → Access (IAM) → API "
"keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys)).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For further information, users can review [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-"
"qiskit).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"steps-cloud-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example scenario {#example-scenario}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This example creates the following setup:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "There are two projects, `ml` and `finance`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `ml` project should have access to the service instances `QR-ml` and "
"`QR-common`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `finance` project should have access to the service instances `QR-"
"finance` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "There are three users:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Fatima should have access to the `ml` project.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Ravi should have access to the `finance` project.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Amyra should have access to both projects.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "It uses access groups without resource groups.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Users are defined in IBM Cloud and project assignments are done there as "
"well.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Users should be able to delete jobs.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The steps to implement this setup are:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Cloud administrator creates three service instances: `QR-ml`, `QR "
"finance`, and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Cloud administrator creates a custom rule that includes the `quantum-"
"computing.job.delete` action.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The Cloud administrator creates two access groups:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The `ml` access group can access `QR-ml` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The `finance` access group can access `QR-finance` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Cloud administrator invites cloud users to the appropriate project. "
"Specifically, they invite and assign users to an access group that includes "
"the project.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Fatima is added to the \"ml\" access group.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Ravi is added to the \"finance\" access group.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Amyra is added to both the \"ml\" and \"finance\" access groups.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Users can log in through the IBM Cloud portal, create API keys, and work "
"with their projects' service instances.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   * See [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) for more information.\n"
"   * Refer to the full [App ID documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
